"Supported Features (See 3GPP TS 29.229 [7])"    Supported-Features                O
"Monitoring Event Configuration (see 8.4.2)"     Monitoring-Event-Configuration    O
"AESE Communication Pattern (see 8.4.25)"        AESE-Communication-Pattern        O
"CIR-Flags (see 8.4.39)"                         CIR-Flags                         O
