; Command: NIDD-Information-Request
; Section: 7.2.3.1
; Table: 7.2.3.1-1
; Page: 39
; Columns: Name                                 AVP                          Cat
"User Identity (see 8.4.36)"                    User-Identifier              M
"Supported Features (See 3GPP TS 29.229 [7])"   Supported-Features           O
"NIDD Authorization Request (see 8.4.44)"       NIDD-Authorization-Request   O
"NIDD Authorization Update (see 8.4.57)"        NIDD-Authorization-Update    O
"NIR Flags"                                     NIR-Flags                    O
"Group User Identifier List"                    Group-User-Identifier        C
"MTC Provider Info"                             MTC-Provider-Info            O


