; Section: 8.4.41
; Table: 8.4.41-1
; Page: 67
; Versions: 18.2.0..19.1.0
"Absence of this AVP shall have the same meaning as all bits cleared (i.e. serving node does not support MONTE)."
    default 0


; Type: Interpreted Constraints ;; interpreted: (TS29.336.dadx#supported-monitoring-events-undefined-bits)
; AVP: Supported-Monitoring-Events
; Within: Supported-Services
; Section: 8.4.41
