"This AVP shall contain the APN Network Identifier (i.e. an APN without the Operator Identifier) per 3GPP TS 23.003 [11], clauses 9.1 & 9.1.1,)."
"The contents of the Service-Selection AVP shall be formatted as a character string composed of one or more labels separated by dots (\".\")."
    encoding labels


